WEBVTT

00:06.760 --> 00:09.650
wasn't enough to defeat Daimidaler.

00:10.250 --> 00:14.840
Ritz is able to fight well, but it isn't enough to achieve complete victory.

00:14.840 --> 00:17.260
Between the Antarctic series and Daimidaler,

00:17.260 --> 00:19.680
just what are we missing?

00:19.920 --> 00:21.360
So true.

00:21.360 --> 00:24.120
It was a copy of the Antarctic series to begin with.

00:24.120 --> 00:27.190
Copy? What do you mean?

00:27.620 --> 00:33.610
Well, a long time ago, the humans stole one of the Antarctic robots that we had accidentally left in town.

00:33.910 --> 00:34.650
What?!

00:34.650 --> 00:39.280
Right, right. They stole the basic technology of the Antarctic series

00:39.280 --> 00:41.510
and used it as a foundation for Daimidaler!

00:41.510 --> 00:43.160
That makes it just a copycat.

00:43.160 --> 00:43.950
So true!

00:44.500 --> 00:48.170
Wait. This is the first time I've heard of this!

00:48.400 --> 00:49.860
Oh! Shoot!

00:49.860 --> 00:52.550
We were keeping this a secret since the Emperor would get mad.

00:53.030 --> 00:55.780
But, isn't it about time?

00:55.780 --> 01:01.500
It was a long time ago and His Highness isn't so small hearted to yell at us for something that's already history.

01:01.500 --> 01:03.270
In any case!

01:03.270 --> 01:07.760
You're telling me Daimidaler was built using our technology, right?!

01:07.760 --> 01:08.730
Yes. Yes.

01:09.240 --> 01:13.070
All human weapons were originally armored vehicles or planes,

01:13.070 --> 01:17.650
so it was strange that a giant robot like that suddenly appeared.

01:18.140 --> 01:19.960
Sweet! He's not gonna scold us!

01:19.960 --> 01:20.950
Looks like it went well.

01:21.520 --> 01:26.760
So why is it the original Antarctic series,

01:26.760 --> 01:30.170
built proudly by our empire, cannot defeat Daimidaler?

01:31.000 --> 01:33.100
All right! Dennis and Michael!

01:33.100 --> 01:37.590
Research Daimidaler to the last detail and report back to me!

01:37.800 --> 01:39.020
Yes, sir!

01:39.020 --> 01:40.590
And also...

01:40.840 --> 01:46.660
No meals for you two until you turn in that report! Understand?!

01:46.660 --> 01:49.110
Crap! He's super angry!

01:49.150 --> 01:54.490
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

01:54.110 --> 02:00.040
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

02:07.460 --> 02:13.130
The darkness is spreading

02:12.800 --> 02:18.550
Why do I keep fighting?

02:18.100 --> 02:29.060
I just don't want to lose these days of peace or the sensation I get to feel with these hands

02:28.770 --> 02:34.570
The sound of moaning gives me power

02:34.030 --> 02:37.160
I won't forgive anyone who tries to take them away

02:42.040 --> 02:47.790
Surge with Hi-ERO particles

02:47.500 --> 02:53.210
Attack when fully charged

03:19.910 --> 03:24.660
Episode 05  :

03:19.910 --> 03:24.660
Mad Dance !The Fearsome Penguin Flyers !

03:24.200 --> 03:26.910
Ah, here it comes!

03:26.910 --> 03:28.750
The active gears!

03:28.750 --> 03:30.920
They've gone crazy!

03:30.920 --> 03:33.550
Professor Sewashiko, don't moan like that!

03:33.550 --> 03:36.420
Jeez! The repairs can't keep up with the damages at this rate!

03:36.970 --> 03:39.260
Complain to those damn penguins!

03:40.680 --> 03:44.760
Kouichi-kun's Hi-ERO particle levels are just incredibly high.

03:45.180 --> 03:48.850
They're putting too much strain on the frame that it's at its limits!

03:48.850 --> 03:52.650
In other words, it's proof of just how perverted Madanbashi is!

03:52.650 --> 03:54.270
Yeah! I'm the best!

03:54.270 --> 03:56.400
Hey, Kouichi-kun.

03:56.690 --> 04:00.280
A school notice that you'll be held back a year due to too many absences arrived.

04:00.280 --> 04:02.660
All right! I'm going to become more perverted!

04:03.870 --> 04:05.540
What are you doing so suddenly?!

04:06.830 --> 04:08.500
As expected of Kyouko.

04:08.870 --> 04:10.670
Your escape techniques are getting so refined.

04:10.960 --> 04:14.460
I'm not going to let you push me down so easily!

04:14.460 --> 04:17.130
Depending on how you take it, that was a pretty unexpected conversation.

04:17.670 --> 04:19.130
Either way,

04:19.130 --> 04:24.390
we need him to make Type-2 last while we finish the new model.

04:24.890 --> 04:30.440
Yes. The new model is one of a kind, so the maintenance cost is large.

04:30.440 --> 04:33.190
But it surpasses the Type-2 in all areas

04:33.190 --> 04:35.650
and is equipped with new and powerful special attacks.

04:37.030 --> 04:38.740
I can't wait until it's done!

04:39.990 --> 04:42.160
I'm begging you! Please!

04:42.360 --> 04:43.950
Even if you say that,

04:43.950 --> 04:47.160
he's only properly attended four days these last three months.

04:47.540 --> 04:49.660
It's a bigger problem than just his grades.

04:50.000 --> 04:51.080
I understand!

04:51.080 --> 04:53.710
But, Kouichi-kun... I mean, Madanbashi-kun,

04:53.710 --> 04:57.340
had special circumstances that prevented him from attending.

04:57.800 --> 04:58.920
Circumstances?

04:59.970 --> 05:03.720
You mean, he's been piloting that robot named Daimidaler?

05:04.090 --> 05:06.680
Yes. He's devoting himself to the world.

05:07.430 --> 05:10.350
Is there any way you could take that into account as well?

05:13.770 --> 05:16.020
You say some funny things!

05:16.020 --> 05:17.900
It's true! He...

05:18.730 --> 05:23.700
Madanbashi! A problem child who only thinks of perverted things, piloting a giant robot?

05:25.320 --> 05:27.120
You have to give me a better excuse than that.

05:27.120 --> 05:28.910
Wait, Kakazu Chieko-sensei!

05:28.910 --> 05:29.950
Kouichi-kun.

05:30.580 --> 05:33.330
I admit, it's a pretty ridiculous situation.

05:33.330 --> 05:35.120
Even I have a hard time believing it.

05:35.580 --> 05:41.630
But this is the honest truth! I'll prove it to you right now!

05:41.880 --> 05:42.760
Prove it?

05:43.840 --> 05:46.340
This is my proof!

05:49.850 --> 05:51.470
Hey! Stop that!

05:51.470 --> 05:53.980
I'm telling you I'll give you proof!

05:51.770 --> 05:53.980
S-Stop it, Kouichi-kun!

05:54.770 --> 05:58.520
Such a different feeling from Kyouko's!

05:58.520 --> 06:01.230
This abundant size and firmness!

06:01.440 --> 06:03.450
Oh, you have technique.

06:04.360 --> 06:06.700
Your skill isn't the level of a regular student.

06:06.700 --> 06:09.200
How about it? Do you understand now?!

06:10.990 --> 06:14.370
So, how does this prove anything?

06:14.580 --> 06:16.460
W-What is this?!

06:16.460 --> 06:20.750
Hey! You're glowing brighter than when you're with me!

06:22.710 --> 06:25.840
You just need to take the makeup exam and pay for ripping her clothes.

06:25.840 --> 06:27.140
Thank goodness.

06:27.140 --> 06:30.140
Whatever. I would have been fine with getting expelled.

06:30.140 --> 06:31.600
Hey, Kouichi-kun!

06:32.100 --> 06:33.770
I won't allow such a thing.

06:33.770 --> 06:36.520
I'm going to help you study for the exam.

06:36.520 --> 06:37.350
There's no need.

06:37.730 --> 06:39.020
Don't worry.

06:39.020 --> 06:41.940
I have to take responsibility for involving you in all of this.

06:41.940 --> 06:43.860
That's not it.

06:43.860 --> 06:49.320
If I have time to study, I'd rather be training for battle!

06:49.320 --> 06:52.040
No! At the very least, you have to graduate properly!

06:52.410 --> 06:54.540
It's none of your business!

06:55.620 --> 06:57.710
What do you mean by that?!

06:57.710 --> 06:58.920
Kouichi-kun!

06:59.460 --> 07:02.380
I'm just saying that it's none of your business because it's not!

07:02.380 --> 07:03.250
What?!

07:03.630 --> 07:05.550
Wait just a second!

07:08.340 --> 07:12.220
Looks like Sonan-chan and Kouichi-kun are fighting again.

07:12.470 --> 07:16.060
It's so stupid. Something like that is one of their usual couple's quarrels.

07:16.520 --> 07:18.480
Sometimes doesn't Professor Moriko

07:18.480 --> 07:20.270
seem like a character that missed her chance at marriage?

07:20.270 --> 07:21.860
Yeah! Yeah! I know!

07:22.610 --> 07:25.070
Hey, now! What's that supposed to mean?

07:26.490 --> 07:29.240
This Antarctic Number 8, Ritz Custom,

07:29.820 --> 07:31.950
is not a normal Antarctic!

07:32.200 --> 07:33.620
It has a secret!

07:33.620 --> 07:36.450
Amazing! What kind of secret does it have?

07:36.620 --> 07:40.210
I cannot say. It's a secret, after all.

07:40.630 --> 07:41.710
Whaaat?

07:41.960 --> 07:46.800
But I'll tell you the secret in secret since you are the pilot.

07:46.800 --> 07:48.550
You have to keep this a secret from your friends, okay?

07:48.550 --> 07:50.090
Yay!

07:50.090 --> 07:51.760
Actually...

07:53.180 --> 07:54.010
Amazing!

07:54.010 --> 07:55.060
Right?

07:58.520 --> 08:02.940
Kyouko, I know that you're just thinking what's best for me.

08:03.610 --> 08:08.440
But, Daimidaler is more important to me than school now.

08:08.820 --> 08:12.240
I can't even win against Rikantz Seaberry properly!

08:12.620 --> 08:14.410
But, if all you do is fight—

08:16.330 --> 08:18.660
There's a reason I have to fight.

08:19.000 --> 08:20.460
Reason?

08:20.460 --> 08:21.750
It's you, Kyouko!

08:23.130 --> 08:26.000
Because of you, I'm piloting Daimidaler.

08:26.000 --> 08:27.300
Th-That's a lie.

08:28.170 --> 08:29.720
I'm not lying.

08:30.680 --> 08:35.470
E-Even if you say something like that so suddenly,

08:35.890 --> 08:37.720
I don't know how to answer...

08:36.720 --> 08:37.720
I mean,

08:38.100 --> 08:40.230
you let me do all sorts of perverted things to you!

08:41.480 --> 08:42.520
Let's go!

08:42.520 --> 08:44.480
Huh? Oh, yes.

08:48.280 --> 08:49.490
I'm sorry!

08:49.490 --> 08:50.990
You're late! Hm?

08:53.280 --> 08:55.740
I didn't give any orders for a bath towel festival, did I?

08:55.740 --> 08:58.240
That's not it. We were in the middle of bathing!

08:58.450 --> 09:01.500
Jeez, at a time like this. My hair is all frizzy!

09:02.290 --> 09:05.630
Daimidaler Type-2, Kouichi, standing by for departure.

09:05.630 --> 09:08.250
Woah! ls today a bath towel festival?!

09:08.250 --> 09:09.760
Th-That's not it!

09:09.760 --> 09:11.630
Professor Sewashiko, standing by!

09:12.380 --> 09:14.260
Daimidaler, shoot in!

09:22.270 --> 09:25.400
Run away before Daimidaler comes!

09:29.190 --> 09:31.440
Well, let's begin!

09:34.110 --> 09:35.490
Th-That is...!

09:35.570 --> 09:36.490
What?!

09:36.570 --> 09:37.490
No way.

09:37.580 --> 09:38.240
Pa—

09:40.120 --> 09:41.960
Passing out flyers?!

09:43.210 --> 09:49.500
We're advertising the great Penguin Empire by passing out flyers!

09:49.500 --> 09:53.090
Otherwise known as Operation:
The Great Penguin Empire Flyer Handout!

09:53.090 --> 09:53.880
Flyer Ritz!

09:53.880 --> 09:56.640
Th-This is bad!

09:56.640 --> 09:59.640
So many fliers! They're fluttering like labia!

09:59.890 --> 10:05.350
The town's scenery will be sullied with their acts of publicity.

10:05.350 --> 10:06.690
That's not all!

10:07.110 --> 10:08.900
Look at the sheer amount of those flyers!

10:09.150 --> 10:10.900
At this rate, there'll be a...

10:11.030 --> 10:14.030
With our tail we zag. Front tail. Thrust! Thrust!

10:11.480 --> 10:14.030
Penguin boom!

10:12.070 --> 10:12.110
Penguin Carnival

10:16.820 --> 10:20.030
Damn! They're so raunchy!

10:20.410 --> 10:23.790
All right, Kyouko! Let's punish those penguins!

10:25.120 --> 10:26.710
What's wrong, Kyouko?

10:27.540 --> 10:28.540
Sorry.

10:29.210 --> 10:30.840
Because of you...

10:33.300 --> 10:34.720
You feeling all right?

10:34.880 --> 10:36.130
Huh?

10:36.130 --> 10:38.180
Oh, no. It's nothing!

10:39.300 --> 10:42.930
I can't stop thinking about him after he said something like that.

10:43.730 --> 10:44.560
Stupid.

10:45.020 --> 10:47.980
Route 12, Matsubakuzushi hatch released!

10:47.980 --> 10:49.940
Daimidaler, shoot out!

10:55.700 --> 10:57.660
Daimidaler has arrived!

10:59.950 --> 11:01.660
He came to us so boldly.

11:01.990 --> 11:03.200
Silly idiot.

11:16.760 --> 11:19.050
You better be prepared, Rikantz Seaberry!

11:19.050 --> 11:20.890
I'll be sure to take you down this time!

11:20.890 --> 11:24.680
You, too. We'll beat you up!

11:24.680 --> 11:27.060
All right, from the front today!

11:28.060 --> 11:31.650
Tandem Seat, Front Attack Mode. Transmutation!

11:36.690 --> 11:37.780
Let's do this, Kyouko!

11:40.950 --> 11:41.910
No!

11:41.910 --> 11:44.870
Oh, your reaction is pretty good today!

11:45.290 --> 11:48.290
No, don't say that!

11:50.210 --> 11:52.960
Hi-ERO particles. All levels stable.

11:52.960 --> 11:55.630
Finger Beam!

11:56.090 --> 11:57.420
Rapid fire!

12:01.260 --> 12:03.010
I won't let you get away!

12:06.060 --> 12:08.180
Finger Punch!

12:14.860 --> 12:16.650
Pretty easy!

12:16.650 --> 12:19.280
Madanbashi is in pretty good spirits.

12:19.280 --> 12:24.240
Yes, at this rate he may finally defeat Rikantz Seaberry this time.

12:24.620 --> 12:28.710
Ouch. You've gone and done it now!

12:29.000 --> 12:33.460
But, this is where it gets serious! Let me show you!

12:33.460 --> 12:35.170
This robot's true form!

12:40.550 --> 12:42.930
Penguin Change!

12:55.190 --> 12:56.230
Complete!

12:56.230 --> 12:59.530
Antarctic 8, Ritz Custom, Beautifully Strong Form!

12:59.530 --> 12:59.530
What the hell is that?

13:01.400 --> 13:02.530
It transformed?

13:02.530 --> 13:04.410
I-It can't be!

13:04.410 --> 13:05.660
No way.

13:06.120 --> 13:07.700
But, otherwise...

13:07.700 --> 13:10.830
There's no reason to change into such a disgusting form.

13:14.250 --> 13:17.050
Initiating Hi-ERO generator!

13:18.340 --> 13:21.090
That's the shine of Hi-ERO particles!

13:21.090 --> 13:22.300
What did you say?!

13:22.880 --> 13:24.140
What's going on?!

13:24.390 --> 13:27.010
The particle level is on par with Daimidaler!

13:27.510 --> 13:29.060
Just as I thought.

13:29.060 --> 13:31.770
That's why it changed forms.

13:32.100 --> 13:35.400
What does the form have to do with the Hi-ERO particles?

13:35.400 --> 13:41.530
Well, Daimidaler is a robot we perfected from our research by taking apart a penguin robot...

13:37.690 --> 13:39.650
Either way, she's now a very dangerous foe!

13:39.650 --> 13:41.530
So what?!

13:41.530 --> 13:44.240
She's just trying to bluff!

13:45.820 --> 13:46.990
Bluff?

13:47.200 --> 13:50.080
Does this look like bluffing to you?!

13:50.080 --> 13:53.580
The Hi-ERO particle generator uses the Factor's seven charades within

13:53.660 --> 13:57.340
the perineum, genitals, navel, chest, throat, forehead,

13:57.340 --> 13:58.500
and vertex of the head.

13:58.500 --> 14:02.510
It uses the various chakras to power and move the various parts

14:00.090 --> 14:01.760
Watch out! Kouichi-kun!

14:02.510 --> 14:04.760
of Daimidaler with Hi-ERO particles.

14:05.890 --> 14:13.230
That's the reason that Daimidaler's design takes on a human form, although such a form is more difficult to use in battle.

14:13.520 --> 14:16.850
I always felt like Daimidaler's right arm wasn't really helpful.

14:17.190 --> 14:19.860
So it was all a design need?!

14:20.070 --> 14:22.320
Surrender and admit defeat already!

14:22.860 --> 14:27.950
The Hi-ERO particle generator you created is working wonderfully!

14:28.450 --> 14:30.660
Dennis! Michael! Good job!

14:30.660 --> 14:31.740
All right!

14:31.740 --> 14:33.160
Now we can eat!

14:36.960 --> 14:38.130
Finger Flash!

14:41.840 --> 14:43.760
Hm? Where...

14:47.930 --> 14:50.800
Finger Beam, maximum power!

14:53.850 --> 14:55.480
Oh! Did they do it?!

14:55.480 --> 14:56.100
No.

14:59.230 --> 15:01.360
The enemy received no damage.

15:01.360 --> 15:04.940
This is the Type-2 Hi-ERO particle barrier?

15:05.320 --> 15:07.450
No, it's even stronger!

15:12.160 --> 15:16.210
Give it up and bow before me in defeat!

15:16.210 --> 15:17.460
This is terrible!

15:17.460 --> 15:19.710
Sam got trapped under the debris!

15:19.710 --> 15:20.920
Hang in there!

15:21.790 --> 15:22.670
Sam!

15:23.050 --> 15:24.670
Sam, are you all right?!

15:24.960 --> 15:27.590
No, his tail has been damaged!

15:27.590 --> 15:29.930
It won't stand tall for a while!

15:30.220 --> 15:34.180
No. Tell us it's not true!

15:38.270 --> 15:40.400
How...

15:41.650 --> 15:43.860
How could you do this to Sam?!

15:49.490 --> 15:52.330
I won't forgive you! I won't forgive you! I won't forgive you!

15:58.460 --> 16:01.040
Administrator, look at this data!

16:02.630 --> 16:04.840
Th-This is...?!

16:05.050 --> 16:08.300
I'll kill anyone who hurts a Penguin-san!

16:13.890 --> 16:15.930
Right arm destroyed! This is bad!

16:16.930 --> 16:19.940
As expected, she's really strong!

16:20.480 --> 16:21.690
Both of you, retreat!

16:21.900 --> 16:24.270
You fool! We haven't lost yet!

16:24.270 --> 16:26.440
The analysis of the enemy robot has finished!

16:26.980 --> 16:28.530
Listen to me calmly.

16:28.530 --> 16:32.950
This robot surpasses Daimidaler in all aspects by over five times!

16:33.240 --> 16:34.080
Five times?!

16:34.370 --> 16:37.790
Five times, she says!

16:42.120 --> 16:43.750
We are ten times stronger!

16:46.420 --> 16:50.010
We can't beat Rikantz Seaberry right now! Retreat, Madanbashi!

16:51.720 --> 16:53.260
No can do.

16:53.840 --> 16:55.010
Kouichi-kun.

16:59.980 --> 17:01.440
Woah, so grotesque!

17:01.440 --> 17:04.150
Hey, isn't there something wrong with Ritz?

17:04.150 --> 17:07.230
A-Actually, I was thinking the same thing as well.

17:11.450 --> 17:14.910
Look! The Antarctic Number 8's chest is blinking?!

17:14.910 --> 17:16.780
Did it have that kind of function?

17:17.910 --> 17:19.040
This is not good!

17:26.880 --> 17:29.170
Hi-ERO generator levels have dropped drastically.

17:29.510 --> 17:30.920
There's no power!

17:30.920 --> 17:33.930
Shit! Move! Move, dammit!

17:34.510 --> 17:38.310
What's wrong? Finished, already? If that's the case...

17:38.430 --> 17:39.310
Die!

17:39.430 --> 17:40.310
Die!

17:40.430 --> 17:42.180
Die!

17:47.730 --> 17:50.320
Extract Ritz from the robot immediately!

17:50.320 --> 17:51.820
Extract her?

17:52.070 --> 17:55.820
But, just a bit longer and she will defeat Daimidaler.

17:56.280 --> 18:01.290
Overcome with feelings, Ritz has become absorbed

18:01.290 --> 18:04.580
by the Hi-ERO particle generator in the Antarctic Number 8, Ritz Custom.

18:04.580 --> 18:05.670
I see.

18:05.670 --> 18:09.750
Ritz doesn't have enough experience in controlling her Hi-ERO particles.

18:09.750 --> 18:11.840
So the robot's gone out of control!

18:12.210 --> 18:15.220
At this rate the robot cannot maintain itself and will explode!

18:15.220 --> 18:18.180
Extract Ritz immediately!

18:18.180 --> 18:20.770
Understood! Penguin Jump!

18:24.810 --> 18:30.440
Die! All people who bully Penguin-sans should die!

18:30.440 --> 18:31.570
I am very sorry.

18:38.660 --> 18:40.240
We have extracted Ritz!

18:40.240 --> 18:41.290
Look!

18:42.200 --> 18:44.580
Antarctic Number 8 is moving on its own?!

18:44.580 --> 18:47.000
E-Even though no one is piloting it.

18:47.000 --> 18:48.460
It's moving!

18:48.670 --> 18:49.750
Probably...

18:50.130 --> 18:54.880
the strong emotions within Hi-ERO particles from Ritz

18:55.300 --> 18:59.010
are moving Antarctic Number 8, Ritz Custom, with its generator.

18:59.010 --> 19:01.390
What a terrifying contraption!

19:02.810 --> 19:04.520
Evacuate the area immediately!

19:04.980 --> 19:07.770
The robot will overload and explode!

19:07.770 --> 19:09.900
Understood!

19:14.820 --> 19:16.650
Daimidaler's movements have completely stopped!

19:16.650 --> 19:19.740
Sonan! Madanbashi! Leave the robot and retreat!

19:19.740 --> 19:20.950
Do an emergency ejection!

19:21.580 --> 19:23.450
R-Roger!

19:26.710 --> 19:30.500
Damn. It's frustrating, but it looks like I lost today.

19:30.500 --> 19:30.920
No!

19:31.590 --> 19:32.710
What's wrong, Kyouko?!

19:33.800 --> 19:34.880
We can't bail out!

19:35.880 --> 19:36.880
What did you say?!

19:40.260 --> 19:41.890
It's beginning to melt down!

19:42.180 --> 19:45.890
At this rate, the entire area will be destroyed!

19:45.890 --> 19:48.230
Escape! You must escape!

19:54.110 --> 19:56.530
The hatch won't open either! What should we do?!

19:57.030 --> 19:59.240
At this rate, it can't be helped.

20:03.870 --> 20:05.950
Kouichi-kun! Wh-What are you...?

20:05.950 --> 20:09.210
Move!

20:29.520 --> 20:32.900
Farewell, Kyouko.

20:36.400 --> 20:38.610
No!

20:41.160 --> 20:44.160
I really loved...

20:49.160 --> 20:50.410
your ti—

21:03.180 --> 21:05.180
Daimidaler Type-2, Kouichi.

21:07.350 --> 21:08.470
Destroyed.

21:10.600 --> 21:13.600
No signs of life.

21:13.600 --> 21:15.440
N-No way.

21:16.360 --> 21:19.440
Kouichi-kun. Sonan-chan.

21:23.660 --> 21:25.620
One life signal!

21:25.620 --> 21:26.530
What?!

21:52.230 --> 21:56.650
I really loved...

21:57.310 --> 21:59.020
Love love li-li-links

21:58.520 --> 21:59.650
Leave it to us

22:00.690 --> 22:01.860
Yes!

22:01.990 --> 22:03.740
Prince

22:16.710 --> 22:21.340
Don't worry about the force of the stars

22:21.090 --> 22:25.590
Let's let our power out

22:25.380 --> 22:29.970
It's best to think about who it is that you want to meet

22:29.720 --> 22:33.770
When you want to meet someone

22:33.730 --> 22:36.480
Preparation okay!

22:35.940 --> 22:38.270
Let's go then!

22:38.060 --> 22:40.770
It'll work out somehow

22:40.230 --> 22:42.570
Let's go with that!

22:42.530 --> 22:46.740
When we have something amazing

22:46.700 --> 22:49.490
Our dreams are one, two, infinite

22:49.120 --> 22:51.330
Let's go, everyone

22:50.450 --> 22:51.580
Yes!

22:51.040 --> 22:55.540
Let's make our own happiness

22:55.370 --> 22:59.710
Because if you only wait for happiness to come to you

22:59.420 --> 23:04.300
You'll never be able to have it

23:04.300 --> 23:08.550
For a happy future, you have to be determined

23:08.300 --> 23:09.890
Love love link

23:09.390 --> 23:11.010
I want to be a bride

23:10.510 --> 23:12.180
Leave it to me

23:11.850 --> 23:15.730
Let's have fun around the world

23:16.600 --> 23:18.190
Oh!

23:17.480 --> 23:18.190
Yay!

23:27.400 --> 23:42.420
Next Episode

23:28.990 --> 23:31.240
If a little girl can pilot a robot and make it go berserk,

23:31.950 --> 23:35.580
something like changing the protagonist should be no big deal.

23:36.870 --> 23:40.790
Next Episode: "Arrival! Shouma and Kiriko."

23:38.870 --> 23:42.420
Arrival !Shouma and Kiriko

23:40.790 --> 23:42.380
Please look forward to it.

23:40.960 --> 23:42.500
Please watch.
